  R:
    vec_slice(df, 5:6)
  Python:
    # vec_slice(df, 5:6) on a data.frame slices rows.
    res_df = df.iloc[4:6].reset_index(drop=True)
    # R's data.frame printing for this case:
    #    x
    # 1  9
    # 2  7
    print("   x")
    for i, val in enumerate(res_df['x'], 1):
        print(f"{i} {val}")
